{"version":1,"content":"<p>憑電影《日掛中天》勇奪第82屆威尼斯影后的內地女星辛芷蕾，封后後演藝事業更上一層樓，工作邀約接踵而至。</p><p>近日，有網民在社交平台分享於維多利亞港海旁偶遇辛芷蕾拍攝的生圖，隨即引起網民熱議。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;從曝光</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T05:44:03.573523+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T05:20:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T05:37:13.355084+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T05:37:13.355084+00:00","content_hash":"782e31fdd4e96e8ae26e8b4c744b8610a0dde66589ba037480eaacf194ef19d3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}